---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /best/
lastmodRun: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Best agent skills, plugins and MCP servers by category, install-tested ({{ seo.dateLabel }})"
  desc: "Category rankings of add-ons for Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi, based on real nightly install tests."
---
<div class="wrap prose"><p class="muted"><a href="/">SkillMaxx</a> › Best by category</p>
<h1 class="ph">Best agent add-ons by category, tested</h1>
<p class="ltb"><a href="/how-we-test/" class="tag tok">Last tested {{ seo.date }}</a></p>
<p class="answer">Each list ranks add-ons by how many of 5 coding agents they installed and loaded in during our nightly sandbox test on {{ seo.dateLabel }}, then by GitHub stars.</p>
<ul>{% for c in seo.categories %}<li><a href="/best/{{ c.slug }}/">Best {{ c.noun }}</a>: {{ c.passing.length }} passed of {{ c.items.length }} tested</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{% if seo.kinds.length %}<h2>By type</h2>
<ul>{% for k in seo.kinds %}<li><a href="/best/{{ k.slug }}/">{{ k.h1 }}</a>: {{ k.passing.length }} of {{ k.items.length }} passed in at least one agent</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
{% if seo.agentTypes.length %}<h2>By agent and type</h2>
<ul>{% for t in seo.agentTypes %}<li><a href="/best/{{ t.slug }}/">{{ t.h1 }}</a>: {{ t.pass }} of {{ t.tested }} passed in {{ t.agentName }} ({{ t.rate }}%)</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
<p class="related-links"><a href="/compare/agents/">Compare agents →</a><a href="/works-in/">What works in each agent →</a><a href="/matrix/">Compatibility matrix →</a></p></div>
